1
00:01:38,050 --> 00:01:43,060
[Shadow Punisher]

2
00:01:43,110 --> 00:01:43,700
[Divine Constable Tally]

3
00:01:43,700 --> 00:01:45,910
[Episode 7]

4
00:01:46,200 --> 00:01:47,000
Also,

5
00:01:48,120 --> 00:01:50,780
if the killer was so precise
with the poisoning,

6
00:01:51,229 --> 00:01:52,039
then any poison

7
00:01:52,039 --> 00:01:53,229
would have worked.

8
00:01:53,590 --> 00:01:55,070
Why choose Corpse-Dissolving Powder,

9
00:01:55,070 --> 00:01:56,270
which is so expensive

10
00:01:56,280 --> 00:01:58,200
and so easy to trace

11
00:01:58,200 --> 00:01:59,350
back to its source?

12
00:02:01,870 --> 00:02:03,000
Well,

13
00:02:03,120 --> 00:02:03,950
newcomer,

14
00:02:04,200 --> 00:02:05,760
that's a sound analysis.

15
00:02:08,750 --> 00:02:09,960
Greetings, Lord Constable Iron.

16
00:02:09,960 --> 00:02:11,400
-I am—
-Then what do you think

17
00:02:11,400 --> 00:02:12,310
the reason is?

18
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:19,260
Only the killer

19
00:02:20,870 --> 00:02:22,520
knows the answer to that.

20
00:02:26,560 --> 00:02:27,360
Alright.

21
00:02:27,710 --> 00:02:28,560
Now that Corpse-Dissolving Powder

22
00:02:28,560 --> 00:02:29,560
has yielded no clues,

23
00:02:29,560 --> 00:02:30,960
let's turn our attention

24
00:02:30,960 --> 00:02:32,190
to the black chest.

25
00:02:33,870 --> 00:02:35,000
I've heard of this method

26
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:36,600
of issuing murder warnings.

27
00:02:37,079 --> 00:02:38,480
Let's wrap things up here

28
00:02:38,520 --> 00:02:40,150
and head to the Tianshu Pavilion
to look for clues.

29
00:02:40,150 --> 00:02:40,840
All right.

30
00:02:41,910 --> 00:02:42,710
Lord Lou,

31
00:02:44,079 --> 00:02:46,340
may I go with you to the Tianshu Pavilion?

32
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:48,960
Of course...

33
00:02:49,960 --> 00:02:50,960
not.

34
00:02:51,470 --> 00:02:52,280
Fall in!

35
00:02:52,280 --> 00:02:52,960
Let's go.

36
00:02:59,560 --> 00:03:00,800
Lady Constable Frost,

37
00:03:00,800 --> 00:03:02,750
now that Prince Wenbu's body is gone,

38
00:03:02,750 --> 00:03:03,710
what should we do

39
00:03:03,960 --> 00:03:05,420
with his bodily fluids...

40
00:03:05,870 --> 00:03:06,960
"The wind leaves a sound,

41
00:03:06,960 --> 00:03:08,360
and water leaves a trace.

42
00:03:08,360 --> 00:03:09,910
Anything that happens

43
00:03:10,080 --> 00:03:12,140
is bound to leave something behind."

44
00:03:12,800 --> 00:03:14,250
Those were the words of advice
and admonition

45
00:03:14,250 --> 00:03:14,970
from the Chief

46
00:03:14,970 --> 00:03:17,630
on the day
I joined the Divine Constable Bureau.

47
00:03:17,910 --> 00:03:19,190
But taking all this back

48
00:03:19,190 --> 00:03:20,230
with us

49
00:03:20,710 --> 00:03:22,240
is going to be quite a chore.

50
00:03:23,280 --> 00:03:24,240
A chore

51
00:03:24,360 --> 00:03:25,590
is always easier

52
00:03:25,800 --> 00:03:27,660
than something mentally taxing.

53
00:03:29,470 --> 00:03:30,310
Well said.

54
00:03:32,400 --> 00:03:33,710
Very well said.

55
00:03:33,960 --> 00:03:35,290
Then I'll leave it to you

56
00:03:35,480 --> 00:03:37,040
to take the body back,

57
00:03:37,160 --> 00:03:38,290
Trainee Constable.

58
00:03:39,190 --> 00:03:39,960
What?

59
00:03:40,280 --> 00:03:41,079
Fall in!

60
00:03:41,079 --> 00:03:41,800
Yes.

61
00:03:53,800 --> 00:03:55,530
Master was right.

62
00:03:56,530 --> 00:03:59,460
Why did I have to come
to the Divine Constable Bureau?

63
00:03:59,800 --> 00:04:02,130
Why did I have to become a constable?

64
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:13,190
Wenbu, oh, Wenbu.

65
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:15,980
I used to be a prince, after all.

66
00:04:16,600 --> 00:04:18,660
Now I'm here to collect your remains.

67
00:04:18,870 --> 00:04:20,600
You can't complain about that.

68
00:04:24,190 --> 00:04:25,600
You really stink.

69
00:04:35,370 --> 00:04:37,620
[Tianshu Pavilion]

70
00:04:55,190 --> 00:04:56,000
Found it!

71
00:05:01,190 --> 00:05:02,190
What did you find?

72
00:05:04,870 --> 00:05:06,600
A case file on murder warnings.

73
00:05:08,310 --> 00:05:09,190
Is there really a secret art

74
00:05:09,190 --> 00:05:11,320
that allows one to foresee the future?

75
00:05:11,870 --> 00:05:13,000
According to this record,

76
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:13,920
there was once a peerless martial artist

77
00:05:13,920 --> 00:05:15,240
in the jianghu.

78
00:05:15,310 --> 00:05:16,920
Whenever he challenged someone to a duel,

79
00:05:16,920 --> 00:05:17,830
he would first

80
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:19,920
send them a black chest
to announce the killing.

81
00:05:19,920 --> 00:05:21,360
He would then kill his opponent

82
00:05:21,360 --> 00:05:22,560
using the move depicted
inside the black chest,

83
00:05:22,560 --> 00:05:23,630
demonstrating

84
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:25,480
his extraordinary martial prowess.

85
00:05:25,480 --> 00:05:26,800
If someone's martial arts mastery

86
00:05:26,800 --> 00:05:28,200
reaches a certain level,

87
00:05:28,390 --> 00:05:29,390
they may indeed be able

88
00:05:29,390 --> 00:05:31,590
to anticipate their opponent's moves.

89
00:05:32,390 --> 00:05:33,560
What was

90
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:35,690
this peerless martial artist's name?

91
00:05:39,140 --> 00:05:41,400
[Divine Constable Bureau]
[Netherworld Swordsman Case]

92
00:05:39,720 --> 00:05:41,320
The Netherworld Swordsman.

93
00:05:41,680 --> 00:05:43,280
The Netherworld Swordsman,

94
00:05:43,510 --> 00:05:44,300
Dao Yin.

95
00:05:45,270 --> 00:05:47,159
The Netherworld Swordsman?

96
00:05:47,560 --> 00:05:48,950
I've never heard of him.

97
00:05:48,970 --> 00:05:49,890
Naturally.

98
00:05:50,560 --> 00:05:52,920
The Netherworld Swordsman
bathed the jianghu in blood

99
00:05:52,920 --> 00:05:54,560
more than thirty years ago.

100
00:05:54,830 --> 00:05:55,720
You and I

101
00:05:55,750 --> 00:05:57,390
were both still young back then.

102
00:05:57,390 --> 00:05:58,690
Could this Dao Yin

103
00:05:58,720 --> 00:06:00,380
have returned to the jianghu?

104
00:06:04,070 --> 00:06:05,030
Mr. Meng,

105
00:06:05,310 --> 00:06:06,310
what do you think?

106
00:06:07,950 --> 00:06:09,270
I know nothing about poison,

107
00:06:09,270 --> 00:06:10,070
nor do I understand

108
00:06:10,070 --> 00:06:11,750
the mindset of someone
who issues murder warnings.

109
00:06:11,750 --> 00:06:13,390
But I do understand swordsmen.

110
00:06:13,390 --> 00:06:14,120
If a swordsman

111
00:06:14,120 --> 00:06:15,480
uses poison instead of his sword,

112
00:06:15,480 --> 00:06:17,210
he is being untrue to the sword.

113
00:06:17,600 --> 00:06:19,000
And a swordsman
who is untrue to the sword

114
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:21,660
can never reach the pinnacle
of swordsmanship.

115
00:06:23,750 --> 00:06:24,560
Wait.

116
00:06:25,160 --> 00:06:27,010
The Netherworld Swordsman

117
00:06:27,070 --> 00:06:30,120
rose to fame thirty years ago.

118
00:06:31,120 --> 00:06:32,150
That would make him

119
00:06:32,150 --> 00:06:34,070
around 70 or 80 by now, wouldn't it?

120
00:06:34,070 --> 00:06:35,200
It's quite possible

121
00:06:35,560 --> 00:06:36,900
that the Netherworld Swordsman's
successor

122
00:06:36,900 --> 00:06:37,790
is still alive.

123
00:06:38,950 --> 00:06:40,480
Do you know the name of the weapon

124
00:06:40,480 --> 00:06:42,810
that the Netherworld Swordsman, Dao Yin,

125
00:06:43,190 --> 00:06:44,750
was

126
00:06:45,390 --> 00:06:46,390
famous for?

127
00:06:47,750 --> 00:06:48,810
What was it called?

128
00:06:49,480 --> 00:06:50,360
That was

129
00:06:51,159 --> 00:06:52,540
the Severe-Cold Sword.

130
00:07:03,480 --> 00:07:05,390
So his name was Dao Yin.

131
00:07:07,270 --> 00:07:09,470
I'd like to ask you something, Mr. Meng.

132
00:07:09,510 --> 00:07:11,460
What was your master's name,

133
00:07:11,560 --> 00:07:13,830
and where is he now?

134
00:07:19,800 --> 00:07:21,060
Are you suspecting me?

135
00:07:21,560 --> 00:07:22,390
Mr. Meng,

136
00:07:23,310 --> 00:07:24,510
there are some questions

137
00:07:24,510 --> 00:07:26,040
we need to clarify with you.

138
00:07:26,190 --> 00:07:29,120
Would you come with us
to the Chief Constable's Hall?

139
00:07:29,390 --> 00:07:30,190
Lou,

140
00:07:30,800 --> 00:07:32,190
Meng Rui is one of us.

141
00:07:32,390 --> 00:07:34,390
How could he possibly be the killer?

142
00:07:34,480 --> 00:07:35,720
This concerns diplomatic relations
between our two countries.

143
00:07:35,720 --> 00:07:36,950
Even if one of our own is involved,

144
00:07:36,950 --> 00:07:38,870
we have to investigate thoroughly.

145
00:07:38,870 --> 00:07:39,680
It's fine.

146
00:07:40,480 --> 00:07:42,000
The innocent have nothing to fear.

147
00:07:42,000 --> 00:07:43,200
Hand over your sword.

148
00:07:50,510 --> 00:07:51,920
I'll go with you.

149
00:07:52,950 --> 00:07:53,810
But I will never

150
00:07:55,170 --> 00:07:56,670
surrender my sword.

151
00:07:56,920 --> 00:07:57,720
Meng Rui.

152
00:07:58,270 --> 00:07:59,610
I'll say it again.

153
00:07:59,750 --> 00:08:01,950
As long as I live, my sword stays with me.

154
00:08:09,310 --> 00:08:10,640
Let's not get worked up.

155
00:08:11,120 --> 00:08:12,360
We're just investigating the case.

156
00:08:12,360 --> 00:08:14,120
We'll get to the bottom of it, all right?

157
00:08:14,120 --> 00:08:15,250
Under Great Shi law,

158
00:08:15,510 --> 00:08:17,160
a suspect must surrender their weapon.

159
00:08:17,160 --> 00:08:18,000
Meng Rui,

160
00:08:18,310 --> 00:08:19,510
surely you know that.

161
00:08:19,800 --> 00:08:21,730
Just because of a name like Dao Yin,

162
00:08:21,750 --> 00:08:23,310
you think I'm a suspect?

163
00:08:23,310 --> 00:08:24,910
I'm investigating the case.

164
00:08:25,750 --> 00:08:27,810
Do you really have something to hide?

165
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:30,160
You can't put it that way.

166
00:08:30,160 --> 00:08:32,360
An investigation needs solid evidence.

167
00:08:32,360 --> 00:08:34,120
I'm only trying to get
to the bottom of this.

168
00:08:34,120 --> 00:08:34,909
Do you really think

169
00:08:34,909 --> 00:08:36,080
I'd make things difficult
for one of my own?

170
00:08:36,080 --> 00:08:36,270
I—

171
00:08:36,270 --> 00:08:37,669
I'll say it one last time.

172
00:08:37,669 --> 00:08:38,870
Hand over your sword.

173
00:08:51,670 --> 00:08:52,590
Lou,

174
00:08:52,750 --> 00:08:54,210
we're all on the same side.

175
00:08:54,510 --> 00:08:56,150
Do me a favor.

176
00:08:56,390 --> 00:08:57,520
Don't get worked up.

177
00:08:57,550 --> 00:08:58,390
Just stay calm.

178
00:08:58,390 --> 00:09:00,650
Why don't you hand him your sword for now?

179
00:09:06,210 --> 00:09:07,310
Stop arguing.

180
00:09:07,870 --> 00:09:08,870
The Chief is here.

181
00:09:09,790 --> 00:09:10,600
Chief.

182
00:09:16,480 --> 00:09:17,270
Meng Rui,

183
00:09:17,750 --> 00:09:19,030
the Divine Constable Bureau

184
00:09:19,030 --> 00:09:19,840
will never

185
00:09:19,840 --> 00:09:21,150
let a wrongdoer go free,

186
00:09:21,150 --> 00:09:22,370
nor will it wrong

187
00:09:22,390 --> 00:09:23,550
an innocent person.

188
00:09:24,000 --> 00:09:24,800
Do you trust me

189
00:09:25,150 --> 00:09:26,200
on that?

190
00:09:26,600 --> 00:09:28,060
I only trust the evidence.

191
00:09:31,200 --> 00:09:32,000
Chief,

192
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:32,870
the Divine Constable Bureau has always

193
00:09:32,870 --> 00:09:34,550
required solid evidence
before taking someone into custody,

194
00:09:34,550 --> 00:09:36,950
especially when one of our own
is involved.

195
00:09:40,870 --> 00:09:42,630
Until the truth comes to light,

196
00:09:43,200 --> 00:09:45,600
you will no longer be involved
in this case.

197
00:09:46,390 --> 00:09:47,360
Effective today,

198
00:09:47,360 --> 00:09:49,080
you are to remain confined
to Winter's Haven

199
00:09:49,080 --> 00:09:50,320
and may not leave without permission.

200
00:09:50,320 --> 00:09:51,250
Any objections?

201
00:09:53,390 --> 00:09:54,360
None.

202
00:10:08,730 --> 00:10:09,630
[Winter's Haven Beneath the Azure Heavens]

203
00:10:10,390 --> 00:10:11,200
Mr. Meng.

204
00:10:16,860 --> 00:10:18,340
[Winter's Haven Beneath the Azure Heavens]

205
00:10:22,390 --> 00:10:24,240
Mr. Meng, forgive us.

206
00:10:26,970 --> 00:10:29,060
[Winter's Haven Beneath the Azure Heavens]

207
00:10:29,960 --> 00:10:31,160
-Mr. Meng.
-Mr. Meng.

208
00:10:32,320 --> 00:10:33,120
Mr. Meng?

209
00:10:36,960 --> 00:10:37,790
Sirs,

210
00:10:38,550 --> 00:10:39,600
are you

211
00:10:39,960 --> 00:10:41,360
monitoring Mr. Meng?

212
00:10:41,360 --> 00:10:42,360
Trainee Constable,

213
00:10:42,360 --> 00:10:44,020
don't ask too many questions.

214
00:10:48,730 --> 00:10:53,020
[Winter's Haven Beneath the Azure Heavens]

215
00:10:50,960 --> 00:10:51,720
Mr. Qi.

216
00:10:51,720 --> 00:10:52,390
Mr. Li.

217
00:10:56,600 --> 00:10:58,600
Are you bringing Mr. Meng some food?

218
00:10:58,670 --> 00:10:59,480
Yes.

219
00:10:59,600 --> 00:11:01,080
I brought him something to eat.

220
00:11:01,080 --> 00:11:02,550
Without the Chief's orders,

221
00:11:02,550 --> 00:11:03,510
Mr. Meng isn't even allowed

222
00:11:03,510 --> 00:11:04,970
to step outside this door.

223
00:11:11,480 --> 00:11:12,270
Mr. Qi,

224
00:11:12,790 --> 00:11:13,790
what's really going on

225
00:11:13,790 --> 00:11:15,240
with Mr. Meng?

226
00:11:15,390 --> 00:11:17,150
I don't know the details.

227
00:11:17,270 --> 00:11:18,630
But I heard

228
00:11:19,270 --> 00:11:20,600
that the Netherworld Swordsman, Dao Yin,

229
00:11:20,600 --> 00:11:22,750
is connected
to the black chest murder warnings.

230
00:11:22,750 --> 00:11:24,950
The Netherworld Swordsman, Dao Yin...

231
00:11:25,270 --> 00:11:26,550
and the black chest murder warnings?

232
00:11:26,550 --> 00:11:27,630
And I also heard

233
00:11:27,870 --> 00:11:29,600
that the person was his master.

234
00:11:31,200 --> 00:11:32,510
His master?

235
00:11:33,270 --> 00:11:34,320
This is classified.

236
00:11:34,320 --> 00:11:35,650
Don't tell anyone else.

237
00:11:38,150 --> 00:11:39,270
I told you, Mr. Meng

238
00:11:39,270 --> 00:11:40,330
has a murderous aura about him.

239
00:11:40,330 --> 00:11:41,390
If he had nothing going on,

240
00:11:41,390 --> 00:11:42,720
why would he be so quiet?

241
00:11:43,150 --> 00:11:44,750
I heard no one at Winter's Haven

242
00:11:44,750 --> 00:11:46,500
has even touched his sword.

243
00:11:46,790 --> 00:11:48,200
If we'd known he was this kind of person,
we should have been

244
00:11:48,200 --> 00:11:50,360
-more cautious around him from the start.
-Mr. Qi,

245
00:11:50,360 --> 00:11:51,620
believe it or not,

246
00:11:51,960 --> 00:11:53,000
by tomorrow,

247
00:11:53,390 --> 00:11:54,270
this won't be

248
00:11:54,270 --> 00:11:55,390
a secret anymore.

249
00:11:55,960 --> 00:11:56,790
By then,

250
00:11:57,550 --> 00:11:59,000
the whole Tianhuang City

251
00:11:59,270 --> 00:12:00,550
might know about it.

252
00:12:18,000 --> 00:12:20,010
Sometimes I wonder,

253
00:12:20,150 --> 00:12:22,120
doesn't he get sore

254
00:12:22,390 --> 00:12:24,390
just sitting there without moving?

255
00:12:24,600 --> 00:12:25,510
Mr. Meng,

256
00:12:26,320 --> 00:12:27,290
I can understand

257
00:12:27,600 --> 00:12:29,460
how you feel

258
00:12:29,790 --> 00:12:31,720
about being treated as the killer.

259
00:12:32,150 --> 00:12:33,150
Think about it.

260
00:12:33,870 --> 00:12:35,480
When we first met,

261
00:12:35,910 --> 00:12:37,600
didn't you suspect me too?

262
00:12:37,870 --> 00:12:38,800
It's no big deal.

263
00:12:46,150 --> 00:12:47,120
Sirs,

264
00:12:47,960 --> 00:12:49,910
Mr. Meng isn't even a suspect yet.

265
00:12:49,960 --> 00:12:51,550
There's no need
to blow this out of proportion.

266
00:12:51,550 --> 00:12:52,600
Think about it.

267
00:12:52,720 --> 00:12:53,720
The killer

268
00:12:54,320 --> 00:12:56,240
would have to be capable

269
00:12:56,390 --> 00:12:58,480
of crafting one of those exquisitely
intricate black chests,

270
00:12:58,480 --> 00:12:59,270
right?

271
00:12:59,960 --> 00:13:01,240
Now look at Mr. Meng.

272
00:13:01,720 --> 00:13:03,960
With those sword-wielding hands of his,

273
00:13:03,960 --> 00:13:05,000
he'd have a hard time

274
00:13:05,000 --> 00:13:06,790
even weaving a scabbard out
of Dragon-whisker Grass.

275
00:13:06,790 --> 00:13:07,750
Let alone

276
00:13:07,960 --> 00:13:09,820
making one of those black chests.

277
00:13:10,720 --> 00:13:11,960
When we investigated the case yesterday,

278
00:13:11,960 --> 00:13:13,150
I observed you.

279
00:13:15,270 --> 00:13:16,600
With your unconventional ideas

280
00:13:16,600 --> 00:13:18,060
and unorthodox approach,

281
00:13:18,080 --> 00:13:19,600
you always manage to make discoveries

282
00:13:19,600 --> 00:13:21,330
in the most unexpected places.

283
00:13:21,390 --> 00:13:23,450
Sounds good. I like what I'm hearing.

284
00:13:24,080 --> 00:13:26,360
If you're going to flatter me,
keep it coming.

285
00:13:26,360 --> 00:13:27,510
Someone like you,

286
00:13:28,120 --> 00:13:30,150
choosing to be
just a trainee constable...

287
00:13:30,150 --> 00:13:32,410
You must have some other purpose in mind.

288
00:13:33,790 --> 00:13:34,630
Mr. Meng,

289
00:13:36,320 --> 00:13:38,150
you're in trouble yourself now.

290
00:13:38,510 --> 00:13:40,970
Maybe you should worry more
about yourself.

291
00:13:48,480 --> 00:13:49,340
Think about it.

292
00:13:50,270 --> 00:13:51,600
A prince of Northern Kun

293
00:13:51,600 --> 00:13:53,810
was killed within Great Shi's borders.

294
00:13:54,030 --> 00:13:54,970
My guess

295
00:13:55,150 --> 00:13:56,790
is that someone wants to use this

296
00:13:56,790 --> 00:13:58,510
to provoke a war
between the two countries

297
00:13:58,510 --> 00:14:00,040
and make you the scapegoat.

298
00:14:01,480 --> 00:14:02,740
You really believe me?

299
00:14:03,390 --> 00:14:04,150
I do.

300
00:14:05,390 --> 00:14:06,960
You're upright
and straightforward by nature.

301
00:14:06,960 --> 00:14:08,620
You could never be the killer.

302
00:14:10,670 --> 00:14:12,200
You can believe in me all you want,

303
00:14:12,200 --> 00:14:13,600
but I still suspect you.

304
00:14:13,790 --> 00:14:14,870
You can have your suspicions,

305
00:14:14,870 --> 00:14:16,200
and I'll keep believing in you.

306
00:14:16,200 --> 00:14:17,000
Either way,

307
00:14:17,360 --> 00:14:19,420
I'll get to the bottom of this for you.

308
00:14:20,150 --> 00:14:21,630
No need. Please leave.

309
00:14:25,200 --> 00:14:26,130
Unfortunately,

310
00:14:26,650 --> 00:14:27,770
this is the area

311
00:14:28,320 --> 00:14:30,050
I'm responsible for cleaning.

312
00:14:31,300 --> 00:14:33,600
[Winter's Haven Beneath the Azure Heavens]

313
00:14:31,790 --> 00:14:32,600
All right, that's enough.

314
00:14:32,600 --> 00:14:34,660
Everyone, go back and get some sleep.

315
00:14:34,790 --> 00:14:36,080
Don't worry. With me here,

316
00:14:36,080 --> 00:14:37,080
he's not going anywhere.

317
00:14:37,080 --> 00:14:38,870
Now get back and have some sleep.

318
00:14:38,870 --> 00:14:39,730
Go on, go to bed.

319
00:14:39,790 --> 00:14:40,600
Go now! Go!

320
00:14:40,720 --> 00:14:41,580
Get some sleep.

321
00:14:43,120 --> 00:14:45,520
-Constable Frost.
-Lady Constable Frost.

322
00:14:47,150 --> 00:14:48,410
Lady Constable Frost.

323
00:14:49,960 --> 00:14:50,670
Yan,

324
00:14:50,670 --> 00:14:52,930
I came to bring Meng Rui something to eat.

325
00:14:58,600 --> 00:14:59,360
Give it to me.

326
00:14:59,360 --> 00:15:00,150
I'll take it

327
00:15:00,200 --> 00:15:01,150
inside later.

328
00:15:01,670 --> 00:15:03,200
Even if you gave it to him right now,

329
00:15:03,200 --> 00:15:04,390
he wouldn't feel like eating.

330
00:15:04,390 --> 00:15:09,610
[Divine Constable Bureau]

331
00:15:13,630 --> 00:15:14,440
Meng Rui!

332
00:15:15,510 --> 00:15:16,750
A life for a life!

333
00:15:17,240 --> 00:15:18,200
Come out!

334
00:15:19,440 --> 00:15:20,360
Come out!

335
00:15:22,590 --> 00:15:24,070
[Divine Constable Bureau]

336
00:15:23,080 --> 00:15:23,870
Meng Rui,

337
00:15:24,760 --> 00:15:25,560
did you

338
00:15:25,580 --> 00:15:27,250
kill Prince Wenbu

339
00:15:27,900 --> 00:15:30,160
to avenge the Netherworld Swordsman?

340
00:15:30,270 --> 00:15:31,390
Is that so?

341
00:15:31,870 --> 00:15:32,750
Meng Rui,

342
00:15:33,790 --> 00:15:35,510
you coward,

343
00:15:36,050 --> 00:15:38,030
will you face me in a fight to the death,

344
00:15:38,030 --> 00:15:39,930
as a man of the jianghu should?

345
00:15:40,360 --> 00:15:41,750
Two hours from now,

346
00:15:41,940 --> 00:15:44,760
[Divine Constable Bureau]

347
00:15:42,150 --> 00:15:43,320
I'll be waiting for you

348
00:15:43,320 --> 00:15:45,360
at Knife-Edge Ridge on Mount Dahuang.

349
00:15:45,360 --> 00:15:46,600
If you don't show up,

350
00:15:47,120 --> 00:15:48,450
all you need to do

351
00:15:49,440 --> 00:15:52,030
is admit that the Netherworld Swordsman
was a fraud

352
00:15:52,030 --> 00:15:53,320
and that the Four Divine Constables

353
00:15:53,320 --> 00:15:55,240
are a bunch of spineless cowards.

354
00:15:58,030 --> 00:15:58,750
Mr. Meng.

355
00:15:58,750 --> 00:15:59,480
Mr. Meng.

356
00:15:59,480 --> 00:15:59,910
Meng Rui!

357
00:15:59,910 --> 00:16:00,840
Don't act rashly.

358
00:16:00,840 --> 00:16:01,870
Yan Zige is trying to provoke you.

359
00:16:01,870 --> 00:16:03,120
Yes, if you don't go,
you can still clear things up.

360
00:16:03,120 --> 00:16:04,120
But if you go, you'll only make yourself
look more suspicious.

361
00:16:04,120 --> 00:16:05,080
Don't go, Mr. Meng.

362
00:16:05,080 --> 00:16:06,080
The Chief is here.

363
00:16:10,840 --> 00:16:11,770
-Chief.
-Chief.

364
00:16:18,550 --> 00:16:19,510
Could it be...

365
00:16:19,840 --> 00:16:20,750
Just now,

366
00:16:21,240 --> 00:16:22,500
the second black chest

367
00:16:22,510 --> 00:16:25,040
was delivered
to the Chief Constable's Hall.

368
00:16:25,440 --> 00:16:26,240
Chief,

369
00:16:26,360 --> 00:16:27,080
Meng Rui has been confined

370
00:16:27,080 --> 00:16:28,870
to Winter's Haven all this time.

371
00:16:28,870 --> 00:16:29,550
Can that show

372
00:16:29,550 --> 00:16:30,950
that he isn't the killer?

373
00:16:30,960 --> 00:16:32,720
Meng Rui was alone
at Winter's Haven.

374
00:16:32,720 --> 00:16:34,150
Who can vouch for him?

375
00:16:35,320 --> 00:16:36,550
With Meng Rui's skills,

376
00:16:36,550 --> 00:16:38,150
delivering a chest to my room

377
00:16:38,150 --> 00:16:39,960
and returning to Winter's Haven

378
00:16:40,270 --> 00:16:41,470
would be effortless.

379
00:16:42,960 --> 00:16:43,750
Open it.

380
00:16:43,750 --> 00:16:44,440
Yes.

381
00:17:21,920 --> 00:17:23,849
This is the second murder warning.

382
00:17:24,030 --> 00:17:25,359
Could these two figures

383
00:17:25,680 --> 00:17:27,349
be Meng Rui and Yan Zige?

384
00:17:30,510 --> 00:17:32,200
In that case, I'll go.

385
00:17:32,430 --> 00:17:33,350
Taking the initiative

386
00:17:33,350 --> 00:17:34,210
might help us make a breakthrough

387
00:17:34,210 --> 00:17:35,100
in the case.

388
00:17:35,240 --> 00:17:36,030
You can't go.

389
00:17:36,070 --> 00:17:36,880
Meng Rui,

390
00:17:37,270 --> 00:17:38,730
if you're truly innocent,

391
00:17:38,750 --> 00:17:39,550
going there means

392
00:17:39,550 --> 00:17:40,830
falling right into their trap.

393
00:17:40,830 --> 00:17:42,270
That's right. Listen, everyone.

394
00:17:42,270 --> 00:17:43,600
Yan Zige has gone quiet.

395
00:17:43,680 --> 00:17:44,350
He must be afraid

396
00:17:44,350 --> 00:17:45,510
of your Severe-Cold Sword.

397
00:17:45,510 --> 00:17:47,030
He got tired of shouting
and quietly went back.

398
00:17:47,030 --> 00:17:47,920
Ignore him.

399
00:17:48,110 --> 00:17:49,110
Reporting!

400
00:17:50,750 --> 00:17:51,550
Chief,

401
00:17:51,680 --> 00:17:52,550
Yan Zige of Northern Kun

402
00:17:52,550 --> 00:17:53,510
has abducted Qi

403
00:17:53,510 --> 00:17:54,920
and injured several of our men.

404
00:17:54,920 --> 00:17:55,750
What?

405
00:17:55,780 --> 00:17:58,110
He dared lay a hand on someone
from the Divine Constable Bureau?

406
00:17:58,110 --> 00:17:59,920
Even as an envoy of Northern Kun,

407
00:18:00,000 --> 00:18:00,750
he can't get away

408
00:18:00,750 --> 00:18:03,750
with causing trouble
at the Divine Constable Bureau!

409
00:18:07,680 --> 00:18:08,680
Where's Meng Rui?

410
00:18:12,480 --> 00:18:14,210
Qi must be rescued safely,

411
00:18:14,270 --> 00:18:15,200
but remember,

412
00:18:15,310 --> 00:18:16,470
more importantly,

413
00:18:16,540 --> 00:18:17,880
we must not let the second

414
00:18:17,880 --> 00:18:19,340
murder warning come true.

415
00:18:19,350 --> 00:18:20,110
-Yes.
-Yes.

416
00:18:20,200 --> 00:18:21,000
Move out!

417
00:18:21,110 --> 00:18:21,920
Let's go.

418
00:18:24,640 --> 00:18:25,550
Chief,

419
00:18:27,880 --> 00:18:29,960
may I come with you?

420
00:18:30,310 --> 00:18:31,350
If I don't allow it,

421
00:18:31,350 --> 00:18:32,550
will you stay behind?

422
00:18:34,880 --> 00:18:36,720
After all, you're
only an auxiliary constable,

423
00:18:36,720 --> 00:18:38,480
so your status
isn't appropriate for this.

424
00:18:38,480 --> 00:18:39,640
Change into some civilian clothes

425
00:18:39,640 --> 00:18:41,640
and act according to the situation.

426
00:18:42,030 --> 00:18:42,830
Yes.

427
00:19:02,920 --> 00:19:03,880
Chief,

428
00:19:03,960 --> 00:19:05,480
so Meng Rui

429
00:19:05,640 --> 00:19:07,190
killed Prince Wenbu

430
00:19:07,270 --> 00:19:09,350
to avenge the Netherworld Swordsman?

431
00:19:09,350 --> 00:19:10,680
Could it be
that the Netherworld Swordsman

432
00:19:10,680 --> 00:19:12,240
had a grudge against Northern Kun?

433
00:19:12,240 --> 00:19:13,260
Thirty years ago,

434
00:19:13,350 --> 00:19:16,160
the Netherworld Swordsman, Dao Yin,
challenged all under heaven.

435
00:19:16,160 --> 00:19:17,440
Many martial arts masters

436
00:19:17,440 --> 00:19:18,830
from both Great Shi
and Northern Kun

437
00:19:18,830 --> 00:19:19,830
fell at his hands.

438
00:19:20,350 --> 00:19:21,680
His arrogance

439
00:19:21,680 --> 00:19:23,350
shook the courts and jianghu
of both countries.

440
00:19:23,350 --> 00:19:24,200
In the end,

441
00:19:24,270 --> 00:19:26,310
Northern Kun was forced
to join forces with Great Shi

442
00:19:26,310 --> 00:19:27,110
and Grand Secretary Bai

443
00:19:27,110 --> 00:19:28,980
to issue a kill order.

444
00:19:29,960 --> 00:19:31,510
Dao Yin fought
over 100 martial arts masters

445
00:19:31,510 --> 00:19:33,800
from both countries, one after another,

446
00:19:34,270 --> 00:19:36,920
as the imperial court and the jianghu
joined forces to hunt him down.

447
00:19:36,920 --> 00:19:37,750
That battle

448
00:19:37,980 --> 00:19:39,830
was a bloodbath.

449
00:20:14,880 --> 00:20:16,070
Thirty years ago,

450
00:20:16,750 --> 00:20:18,480
the Netherworld Swordsman, Dao Yin,

451
00:20:18,480 --> 00:20:20,400
was surrounded by martial arts masters

452
00:20:20,400 --> 00:20:21,480
from Northern Kun and Great Shi

453
00:20:21,480 --> 00:20:23,270
right here at Knife-Edge Ridge.

454
00:20:23,270 --> 00:20:25,270
After three days and three nights
of fierce fighting,

455
00:20:25,270 --> 00:20:28,000
they finally knocked him off the cliff,

456
00:20:28,070 --> 00:20:29,550
and he vanished without a trace.

457
00:20:29,550 --> 00:20:31,070
Since he passed the Severe-Cold Sword

458
00:20:31,070 --> 00:20:32,240
on to you,

459
00:20:32,640 --> 00:20:34,500
that means he survived back then.

460
00:20:34,830 --> 00:20:35,680
Is he

461
00:20:36,640 --> 00:20:37,790
still alive now?

462
00:20:40,070 --> 00:20:41,400
None of your business.

463
00:20:50,110 --> 00:20:51,110
You're not fighting back?

464
00:20:51,110 --> 00:20:52,530
Yan Zige, listen to me.

465
00:20:52,750 --> 00:20:53,720
The second black chest murder warning

466
00:20:53,720 --> 00:20:54,510
has already been issued.

467
00:20:54,510 --> 00:20:55,350
What's depicted inside

468
00:20:55,350 --> 00:20:56,830
is exactly what's happening here.

469
00:20:56,830 --> 00:20:57,750
If I strike,

470
00:20:57,750 --> 00:20:59,240
I'll be falling right into their trap.

471
00:20:59,240 --> 00:21:00,070
Enough talk.

472
00:21:00,920 --> 00:21:02,790
I'll make you draw your sword.

473
00:21:11,510 --> 00:21:12,310
Jiang Zhan, Ding Mao,

474
00:21:12,310 --> 00:21:14,640
set up the Heaven's Net and Earth's Snare!

475
00:21:29,830 --> 00:21:30,640
Thank you.

476
00:21:51,030 --> 00:21:52,880
Yan Zige's every move
is aimed at killing.

477
00:21:52,880 --> 00:21:55,210
Meng Rui,
don't get caught up in the fight!

478
00:22:10,030 --> 00:22:11,310
Meng Rui, don't!

479
00:22:32,880 --> 00:22:33,680
How is he?

480
00:22:35,240 --> 00:22:36,200
He's dead.

481
00:22:38,350 --> 00:22:39,160
Meng Rui,

482
00:22:39,440 --> 00:22:40,640
what have you done?

483
00:22:40,720 --> 00:22:41,930
I didn't kill him.

484
00:22:42,160 --> 00:22:42,880
I only used 30% of my strength

485
00:22:42,880 --> 00:22:43,920
in that last strike.

486
00:22:43,920 --> 00:22:44,350
How could I have killed him

487
00:22:44,350 --> 00:22:45,590
with one blow?

488
00:22:49,640 --> 00:22:50,480
Soliders,

489
00:22:50,680 --> 00:22:52,030
seize the killer, Meng Rui!

490
00:22:52,030 --> 00:22:52,880
Lord Xiao,

491
00:22:53,030 --> 00:22:54,440
how can someone
from the Divine Constable Bureau

492
00:22:54,440 --> 00:22:55,830
be tried by the Ministry of Justice?

493
00:22:55,770 --> 00:22:59,360
[Xiao Ning, Vice Minister of Justice]

494
00:22:56,200 --> 00:22:57,310
A life for a life.

495
00:22:57,480 --> 00:22:58,310
Does the Divine Constable Bureau think

496
00:22:58,310 --> 00:22:59,920
it can disregard the laws
of the imperial court?

497
00:22:59,920 --> 00:23:01,320
I didn't kill him.

498
00:23:01,440 --> 00:23:02,920
How can you say we disregarded the law?

499
00:23:02,920 --> 00:23:03,720
Mr. Meng.

500
00:23:03,880 --> 00:23:04,720
Lord Xiao.

501
00:23:05,070 --> 00:23:06,400
Yan Zige held me hostage.

502
00:23:06,400 --> 00:23:08,060
Mr. Meng was trying to save me.

503
00:23:08,070 --> 00:23:09,880
I'm sorry, Mr. Meng.

504
00:23:13,030 --> 00:23:14,050
The Ministry of Justice
and the Divine Constable Bureau

505
00:23:14,050 --> 00:23:15,240
have never gotten along.

506
00:23:15,240 --> 00:23:17,680
They've been looking for an excuse
to cause trouble.

507
00:23:17,680 --> 00:23:19,200
Now that Yan Zige is dead,

508
00:23:19,310 --> 00:23:21,370
they've finally found their chance.

509
00:23:21,640 --> 00:23:23,830
If you let them take you in
just like that,

510
00:23:23,830 --> 00:23:25,890
don't expect to come out in one piece.

511
00:23:27,070 --> 00:23:28,000
Lord Xiao,

512
00:23:28,000 --> 00:23:30,200
the Divine Constable Bureau
has always upheld strict laws.

513
00:23:30,200 --> 00:23:31,790
Once the truth is established,

514
00:23:31,790 --> 00:23:33,270
if Meng Rui did kill someone,

515
00:23:33,270 --> 00:23:34,160
I will personally

516
00:23:34,160 --> 00:23:35,640
hand him over to the Ministry of Justice
for punishment.

517
00:23:35,640 --> 00:23:37,200
Meng Rui killed a man

518
00:23:37,200 --> 00:23:38,030
in full view of everyone.

519
00:23:38,030 --> 00:23:39,030
That's the truth.

520
00:23:39,030 --> 00:23:39,830
Meng Rui,

521
00:23:39,920 --> 00:23:41,310
surrender your sword

522
00:23:41,310 --> 00:23:42,240
and submit to arrest at once.

523
00:23:42,240 --> 00:23:43,890
If you resist arrest
with your martial arts...

524
00:23:43,890 --> 00:23:45,620
Sever the tendons in his hands.

525
00:23:46,880 --> 00:23:47,920
The interrogation hasn't even begun,

526
00:23:47,920 --> 00:23:49,000
and the evidence isn't conclusive.

527
00:23:49,000 --> 00:23:50,110
How can you resort to torture?

528
00:23:50,110 --> 00:23:51,960
Who among you dares lay a hand on him?

529
00:23:51,960 --> 00:23:52,750
Yan Cheng.

530
00:24:00,440 --> 00:24:01,700
Why are you still here?

531
00:24:03,880 --> 00:24:04,680
Go!

532
00:24:08,680 --> 00:24:09,480
Seize him!

533
00:24:10,080 --> 00:24:12,190
Meng Rui, how dare you escape!

534
00:24:41,400 --> 00:24:44,000
How dare you aid and abet the escape
of a prisoner!

535
00:24:44,000 --> 00:24:44,790
My Lord,

536
00:24:46,000 --> 00:24:49,200
this Thousand-Mechanism Formation
requires great precision.

537
00:24:49,200 --> 00:24:50,110
Keep

538
00:24:50,110 --> 00:24:51,560
yelling at me,

539
00:24:51,830 --> 00:24:53,350
and I might make a mistake.

540
00:25:03,660 --> 00:25:07,180
[Sucheng, Border of the Great Shi]

541
00:25:09,790 --> 00:25:10,650
Your Highness.

542
00:25:11,750 --> 00:25:12,680
Third Prince,

543
00:25:12,720 --> 00:25:13,680
we're outnumbered.

544
00:25:13,680 --> 00:25:14,740
We should retreat.

545
00:25:18,030 --> 00:25:19,070
If Sucheng falls,

546
00:25:19,770 --> 00:25:25,230
[Zhou Zhu, Prince Ping,
Third Prince of the Great Shi]

547
00:25:20,270 --> 00:25:22,720
there will be no stronghold left
on Great Shi's northern frontier.

548
00:25:22,720 --> 00:25:23,720
Tianhuang City

549
00:25:24,180 --> 00:25:25,510
will be in grave danger.

550
00:25:25,620 --> 00:25:27,570
[Great Shi]

551
00:25:25,680 --> 00:25:26,550
Soldiers,

552
00:25:26,880 --> 00:25:28,070
defend Sucheng.

553
00:25:28,590 --> 00:25:29,830
We swear to fight
to the death and never retreat!

554
00:25:29,830 --> 00:25:31,680
We swear to fight
to the death and never retreat!

555
00:25:31,680 --> 00:25:34,340
We swear to fight
to the death and never retreat!

556
00:25:46,310 --> 00:25:49,070
Even if we seek peace now,
I'm afraid it's too late.

557
00:25:49,070 --> 00:25:51,070
It seems this won't end peacefully.

558
00:25:56,110 --> 00:25:56,920
Your Majesty,

559
00:25:58,310 --> 00:26:00,570
Northern Kun has been attacking Sucheng

560
00:26:00,720 --> 00:26:02,830
for three days straight
over Wenbu's death.

561
00:26:02,830 --> 00:26:04,310
Prince Ping may be a formidable warrior,

562
00:26:04,310 --> 00:26:05,680
but the enemy outnumbers our forces

563
00:26:05,680 --> 00:26:07,030
several times over.

564
00:26:07,030 --> 00:26:07,750
I'm afraid

565
00:26:08,310 --> 00:26:09,510
Sucheng may not hold.

566
00:26:10,110 --> 00:26:11,830
The people of Northern Kun
have been demanding

567
00:26:11,830 --> 00:26:13,440
that we hand over the murderer, Meng Rui.

568
00:26:13,440 --> 00:26:15,270
It seems the crisis
on the northern frontier

569
00:26:15,270 --> 00:26:16,670
won't be resolved as long

570
00:26:16,680 --> 00:26:18,280
as Meng Rui remains at large.

571
00:26:18,590 --> 00:26:20,790
I agree with what my elder brother said.

572
00:26:21,160 --> 00:26:21,960
Your Majesty,

573
00:26:22,440 --> 00:26:23,830
I second his proposal.

574
00:26:23,920 --> 00:26:24,720
It's quite rare

575
00:26:24,720 --> 00:26:26,350
for the two of you

576
00:26:28,070 --> 00:26:29,270
to agree for once.

577
00:26:34,510 --> 00:26:36,200
I have one more matter to report.

578
00:26:36,200 --> 00:26:38,030
According to Xiao Ning
of the Ministry of Justice,

579
00:26:38,030 --> 00:26:40,270
Meng Rui had already surrendered.

580
00:26:40,270 --> 00:26:41,590
But Li Si,

581
00:26:41,590 --> 00:26:43,200
a trainee constable
of the Divine Constable Bureau,

582
00:26:43,200 --> 00:26:44,510
bent the law for personal reasons
and deliberately

583
00:26:44,510 --> 00:26:46,440
obstructed the Ministry of Justice
from taking Meng Rui into custody,

584
00:26:46,440 --> 00:26:47,830
allowing him to escape.

585
00:26:49,070 --> 00:26:51,790
I ask that Your Majesty
punish Li Si severely.

586
00:26:52,070 --> 00:26:52,880
Your Majesty,

587
00:26:53,070 --> 00:26:54,640
from what I understand,

588
00:26:54,830 --> 00:26:56,760
Li Si had already subdued Meng Rui.

589
00:26:57,000 --> 00:26:59,070
It was Xiao Ning
of the Ministry of Justice

590
00:26:59,070 --> 00:27:00,340
who failed to do his job

591
00:27:00,440 --> 00:27:01,590
and held things up,

592
00:27:01,830 --> 00:27:03,400
allowing Meng Rui to escape.

593
00:27:03,400 --> 00:27:05,070
I ask that Your Majesty
hold him accountable.

594
00:27:05,070 --> 00:27:06,310
Crown Prince, your words

595
00:27:06,310 --> 00:27:07,640
clearly suggest an attempt
to shield someone.

596
00:27:07,640 --> 00:27:08,880
Isn't that trainee constable Li Si

597
00:27:08,880 --> 00:27:09,790
one of your men?

598
00:27:09,790 --> 00:27:10,510
Brother,

599
00:27:10,720 --> 00:27:11,830
at a time like this,

600
00:27:12,030 --> 00:27:13,440
before His Majesty

601
00:27:13,590 --> 00:27:15,270
and when it comes to matters of state,

602
00:27:15,270 --> 00:27:16,640
why are we still talking about
what's yours and what's mine?

603
00:27:16,640 --> 00:27:17,440
Your Majesty,

604
00:27:17,640 --> 00:27:18,510
I believe

605
00:27:18,510 --> 00:27:19,680
our most urgent task

606
00:27:19,680 --> 00:27:21,270
is to capture Meng Rui
and bring him to justice.

607
00:27:21,270 --> 00:27:22,510
Even if Li Si is guilty,

608
00:27:22,510 --> 00:27:24,640
he should be allowed
to atone through meritorious service.

609
00:27:24,640 --> 00:27:25,900
I ask Your Majesty to decide.

610
00:27:25,900 --> 00:27:26,720
Your Majesty,

611
00:27:26,830 --> 00:27:28,480
the Divine Constable Bureau
is suspected of showing favoritism.

612
00:27:28,480 --> 00:27:29,400
Why not

613
00:27:29,400 --> 00:27:30,790
have the Ministry of Justice
handle this case entirely?

614
00:27:30,790 --> 00:27:31,270
Your Majesty.

615
00:27:31,270 --> 00:27:32,070
Enough.

616
00:27:36,070 --> 00:27:38,870
Issue a warrant
for Meng Rui throughout the realm.

617
00:27:39,680 --> 00:27:42,880
We'll bring Meng Rui in first
and deal with the rest later.

618
00:27:43,680 --> 00:27:44,680
Both the First Prince
and the Crown Prince

619
00:27:44,680 --> 00:27:45,830
have a point.

620
00:27:46,000 --> 00:27:46,860
How about this:

621
00:27:47,830 --> 00:27:49,400
the Ministry of Justice will work together
with the Divine Constable Bureau

622
00:27:49,400 --> 00:27:50,510
to hunt him down.

623
00:27:51,200 --> 00:27:52,000
For this case,

624
00:27:52,680 --> 00:27:53,830
the Ministry of Justice
need not be subject

625
00:27:53,830 --> 00:27:56,070
to the Divine Constable Bureau's
authority.

626
00:27:56,070 --> 00:27:57,130
Yes, Your Majesty.

627
00:28:08,070 --> 00:28:08,920
Strange.

628
00:28:09,070 --> 00:28:09,790
Yan Zige did indeed

629
00:28:09,790 --> 00:28:11,400
die from a ruptured heart meridian,

630
00:28:11,400 --> 00:28:13,680
but his ribs are completely intact.

631
00:28:16,920 --> 00:28:18,120
Where is Li Qingyang?

632
00:28:18,200 --> 00:28:19,530
Tell him to get out here.

633
00:28:22,110 --> 00:28:23,160
We at Star-Gathering Pavilion

634
00:28:23,160 --> 00:28:25,170
run a clean and lawful business.

635
00:28:25,350 --> 00:28:27,400
Even officials
from the Ministry of Justice

636
00:28:27,400 --> 00:28:29,400
can't be this overbearing.

637
00:28:29,400 --> 00:28:30,890
Sharp tongue.

638
00:28:31,000 --> 00:28:32,200
If I don't teach you a lesson...

639
00:28:32,200 --> 00:28:33,640
This lady is right.

640
00:28:34,790 --> 00:28:35,550
Lord Xiao,

641
00:28:35,550 --> 00:28:37,160
you represent the imperial court.

642
00:28:37,160 --> 00:28:38,830
You should conduct yourself properly

643
00:28:38,830 --> 00:28:40,000
and treat people with courtesy.

644
00:28:40,000 --> 00:28:41,000
Only then

645
00:28:41,020 --> 00:28:43,000
will the people of Great Shi respect

646
00:28:43,000 --> 00:28:43,830
and trust you.

647
00:28:45,310 --> 00:28:46,440
Yes, Your Highness.

648
00:28:46,640 --> 00:28:48,440
And who might this gentleman be?

649
00:28:48,830 --> 00:28:50,640
His Highness Prince Ding is here.

650
00:28:50,640 --> 00:28:52,900
Have Li Qingyang come out to receive him.

651
00:28:58,070 --> 00:28:58,880
Get up.

652
00:29:13,240 --> 00:29:16,000
I, Li Qingyang, pay my respects,
Your Highness.

653
00:29:17,200 --> 00:29:18,240
Why aren't you kneeling

654
00:29:18,240 --> 00:29:19,640
before the First Prince?

655
00:29:26,110 --> 00:29:27,750
The First Prince's reputation
as a wise prince

656
00:29:27,750 --> 00:29:29,150
is renowned far and wide.

657
00:29:29,440 --> 00:29:31,240
I'm so honored to meet you today

658
00:29:31,550 --> 00:29:33,350
that I was beside myself with joy

659
00:29:33,350 --> 00:29:34,680
and forgot my manners.

660
00:29:35,030 --> 00:29:36,200
Please forgive me.

661
00:29:37,590 --> 00:29:39,190
I am Li Si, a humble commoner.

662
00:29:39,310 --> 00:29:40,110
I pay my—

663
00:29:40,550 --> 00:29:42,240
Young Master Qingyang,
there's no need for such formalities.

664
00:29:42,240 --> 00:29:43,030
But

665
00:29:43,920 --> 00:29:44,720
have we

666
00:29:45,200 --> 00:29:46,880
met somewhere before?

667
00:29:49,030 --> 00:29:50,560
I have an unremarkable face

668
00:29:50,720 --> 00:29:52,440
and am easily mistaken for others.

669
00:29:52,440 --> 00:29:53,240
Perhaps

670
00:29:54,200 --> 00:29:56,400
Your Highness remembers incorrectly.

671
00:29:59,160 --> 00:30:00,220
I heard

672
00:30:00,830 --> 00:30:01,960
the murderer, Meng Rui,

673
00:30:01,960 --> 00:30:02,830
was about

674
00:30:02,830 --> 00:30:04,330
to be taken into custody,

675
00:30:05,110 --> 00:30:06,350
yet for some reason,

676
00:30:06,790 --> 00:30:08,510
you let him go.

677
00:30:12,550 --> 00:30:13,920
Your Highness,

678
00:30:15,440 --> 00:30:17,500
are you here to investigate the case?

679
00:30:19,240 --> 00:30:20,920
If you're here on official business,

680
00:30:20,920 --> 00:30:23,350
then as a member
of the Divine Constable Bureau,

681
00:30:23,350 --> 00:30:24,960
it's my duty to ask Your Highness:

682
00:30:24,960 --> 00:30:26,750
will our conversation today

683
00:30:27,510 --> 00:30:29,350
be entered into the official record?

684
00:30:29,350 --> 00:30:30,200
Insolent!

685
00:30:31,110 --> 00:30:31,970
Your Highness,

686
00:30:32,640 --> 00:30:34,440
Dao Yin's sword trial across the world

687
00:30:34,440 --> 00:30:36,160
was thirty years ago.

688
00:30:36,200 --> 00:30:37,640
Isn't it a bit biased

689
00:30:37,790 --> 00:30:39,310
to infer Meng Rui's motive for murder

690
00:30:39,310 --> 00:30:41,620
was to avenge his master

691
00:30:42,200 --> 00:30:43,920
based on a single black chest?

692
00:30:44,030 --> 00:30:45,880
If we're talking motive alone,

693
00:30:45,960 --> 00:30:47,330
no one is more suspicious

694
00:30:47,330 --> 00:30:49,070
than him right now.

695
00:30:50,590 --> 00:30:51,590
Not necessarily.

696
00:30:51,960 --> 00:30:54,000
With the Northern Kun army
massing at the border,

697
00:30:54,000 --> 00:30:55,240
the court has no choice but

698
00:30:55,240 --> 00:30:57,030
to send veteran ministers
and seasoned generals

699
00:30:57,030 --> 00:30:58,730
to defend the frontier.

700
00:30:58,920 --> 00:31:00,200
That means every military officer,

701
00:31:00,200 --> 00:31:01,000
whether stationed here

702
00:31:01,000 --> 00:31:02,570
in Tianhuang City

703
00:31:02,960 --> 00:31:04,510
or sent to the frontier

704
00:31:04,640 --> 00:31:06,520
to fight Northern Kun,

705
00:31:06,590 --> 00:31:07,350
has a chance

706
00:31:07,350 --> 00:31:09,070
to earn merit and advance.

707
00:31:09,240 --> 00:31:10,350
If we're talking motives,

708
00:31:10,350 --> 00:31:11,830
the Ministry of War has one too.

709
00:31:11,830 --> 00:31:13,360
And wouldn't Your Highness

710
00:31:13,700 --> 00:31:15,200
have an even stronger motive?

711
00:31:15,200 --> 00:31:16,000
You—

712
00:31:17,550 --> 00:31:18,440
The Ministry of War

713
00:31:18,440 --> 00:31:20,270
has long been beyond my control.

714
00:31:20,440 --> 00:31:21,900
How can you conclude

715
00:31:22,030 --> 00:31:23,440
that Meng Rui is the murderer

716
00:31:23,440 --> 00:31:26,350
based on motive alone?

717
00:31:32,590 --> 00:31:34,120
So, Young Master Qingyang,

718
00:31:34,200 --> 00:31:35,980
you're quite the debater.

719
00:31:36,000 --> 00:31:37,170
In that case,

720
00:31:37,440 --> 00:31:38,970
I won't keep you any longer.

721
00:31:39,830 --> 00:31:42,200
But let me tell you this:

722
00:31:42,200 --> 00:31:44,440
as a member
of the Divine Constable Bureau,

723
00:31:44,440 --> 00:31:46,310
I hope you uphold the law
and remain impartial.

724
00:31:46,310 --> 00:31:48,840
If you abuse your position
to shield someone,

725
00:31:49,240 --> 00:31:52,550
even the Crown Prince
won't be able to protect you.

726
00:31:54,640 --> 00:31:56,040
What I want to say is this:

727
00:31:57,790 --> 00:31:59,400
now that I have joined
the Divine Constable Bureau,

728
00:31:59,400 --> 00:32:00,790
I will never wrong

729
00:32:00,790 --> 00:32:02,720
an innocent person,

730
00:32:02,920 --> 00:32:03,960
nor will I ever

731
00:32:03,960 --> 00:32:05,620
let a single murderer go free,

732
00:32:05,640 --> 00:32:07,200
even if that murderer

733
00:32:08,920 --> 00:32:11,110
has evaded justice for years.

734
00:32:14,920 --> 00:32:15,720
Good.

735
00:32:17,550 --> 00:32:18,750
Very good.

736
00:32:21,000 --> 00:32:21,790
Let's go.

737
00:32:28,880 --> 00:32:29,680
Jin Se.

738
00:32:32,270 --> 00:32:33,070
Master.

739
00:32:33,110 --> 00:32:34,640
What the First Prince said just now

740
00:32:34,640 --> 00:32:36,100
reminded me of something.

741
00:32:37,030 --> 00:32:38,240
Seventeen years ago,

742
00:32:38,510 --> 00:32:39,270
the Ministry of War

743
00:32:39,270 --> 00:32:41,800
was indeed
under the First Prince's control.

744
00:32:42,550 --> 00:32:44,750
I need you to look
into something for me.

745
00:32:45,440 --> 00:32:47,000
Around the ninth day
of the second month

746
00:32:47,000 --> 00:32:48,530
of the 20th year of Hongyun,

747
00:32:48,960 --> 00:32:50,550
did any urgent military reports
from the Ministry of War

748
00:32:50,550 --> 00:32:51,610
reach the Emperor?

749
00:32:52,400 --> 00:32:53,640
If so,

750
00:32:54,240 --> 00:32:55,370
I want a complete list
of all personnel transfers

751
00:32:55,370 --> 00:32:56,440
and all promotions, demotions,
rewards, and punishments

752
00:32:56,440 --> 00:32:59,200
in the Ministry of War
before and after that period.

753
00:32:59,200 --> 00:33:00,000
Yes.

754
00:33:08,440 --> 00:33:09,500
-Master.
-Master.

755
00:33:10,830 --> 00:33:12,200
Everyone, leave for now.

756
00:33:12,200 --> 00:33:13,000
-Yes.
-Yes.

757
00:33:15,720 --> 00:33:17,480
This 200,000 taels in banknotes

758
00:33:17,480 --> 00:33:18,680
is a token of my respect

759
00:33:18,680 --> 00:33:19,920
for the Crown Prince.

760
00:33:19,920 --> 00:33:22,350
Eunuch Zhao, I'd appreciate it
if you could deliver it to His Highness.

761
00:33:22,350 --> 00:33:23,310
Li Qingyang,

762
00:33:24,350 --> 00:33:26,680
so you do still remember the Crown Prince.

763
00:33:28,720 --> 00:33:30,160
Meng Rui has really

764
00:33:30,920 --> 00:33:32,980
stirred up a hornet's nest this time.

765
00:33:33,720 --> 00:33:35,350
The court and Northern Kun

766
00:33:35,350 --> 00:33:37,750
would love nothing more than
to tear him limb from limb.

767
00:33:37,750 --> 00:33:38,960
And you?

768
00:33:39,480 --> 00:33:41,400
You went and let him escape.

769
00:33:42,000 --> 00:33:43,060
Do you have any idea

770
00:33:43,720 --> 00:33:46,830
how much trouble
you've caused the Crown Prince?

771
00:33:49,750 --> 00:33:52,010
That's what Xiao Ning told you, isn't it?

772
00:33:56,830 --> 00:33:57,590
Eunuch Zhao,

773
00:33:57,590 --> 00:33:59,590
Xiao Ning is the First Prince's man.

774
00:33:59,790 --> 00:34:01,120
How can the Crown Prince

775
00:34:01,160 --> 00:34:02,640
take his word for it?

776
00:34:03,480 --> 00:34:04,750
That day, the Ministry of Justice

777
00:34:04,750 --> 00:34:07,480
and the Divine Constable Bureau
were both there.

778
00:34:07,960 --> 00:34:09,960
Even if they had captured Meng Rui
on the spot,

779
00:34:09,960 --> 00:34:12,400
it wouldn't have counted
as the Crown Prince's achievement.

780
00:34:12,400 --> 00:34:13,190
But what if

781
00:34:13,760 --> 00:34:14,960
I were to bring Meng Rui

782
00:34:14,960 --> 00:34:15,960
back on my own?

783
00:34:17,230 --> 00:34:18,070
You?

784
00:34:18,960 --> 00:34:19,920
Are you saying

785
00:34:19,920 --> 00:34:21,510
you know where Meng Rui is?

786
00:34:23,000 --> 00:34:24,920
Forty or fifty thousand people

787
00:34:24,920 --> 00:34:27,320
across Tianhuang City
are looking for him.

788
00:34:28,320 --> 00:34:29,980
And you think you can find him?

789
00:34:34,590 --> 00:34:35,920
There is only one kind of person

790
00:34:35,920 --> 00:34:37,000
in this world

791
00:34:37,000 --> 00:34:38,030
whom I can't find.

792
00:34:41,360 --> 00:34:43,230
Someone who has lost themselves.

793
00:34:44,670 --> 00:34:45,580
Unless they

794
00:34:46,190 --> 00:34:47,360
find themselves,

795
00:34:48,150 --> 00:34:49,550
no one else can find them.

796
00:34:52,710 --> 00:34:54,170
But Meng Rui is different.

797
00:34:54,710 --> 00:34:56,000
He's the kind of person

798
00:34:56,020 --> 00:34:57,960
who would never lose his way,
no matter what.

799
00:34:57,960 --> 00:34:59,150
Someone like him?

800
00:35:00,000 --> 00:35:01,030
I'd find him

801
00:35:02,360 --> 00:35:04,160
even if he were reduced to ashes.

802
00:35:09,190 --> 00:35:11,110
Young Master Qingyang,

803
00:35:14,710 --> 00:35:19,230
I hope your actions prove even better
than your words.

804
00:35:25,150 --> 00:35:25,960
However,

805
00:35:26,710 --> 00:35:27,710
there's one more thing

806
00:35:27,710 --> 00:35:29,710
I'd like to ask your advice on.

807
00:35:31,110 --> 00:35:31,920
Go ahead.

808
00:35:34,510 --> 00:35:37,190
The Ministry of War
is in the Crown Prince's hands.

809
00:35:37,190 --> 00:35:39,510
With Prince Wenbu dead,
the Ministry of War stands to gain.

810
00:35:39,510 --> 00:35:41,150
Does the Crown Prince truly want

811
00:35:41,150 --> 00:35:43,150
the Divine Constable Bureau
to bring the real murderer to justice?

812
00:35:43,150 --> 00:35:45,150
Li Qingyang, have you lost your mind?

813
00:35:45,150 --> 00:35:46,710
How dare you drag
the Crown Prince into this?

814
00:35:46,710 --> 00:35:47,440
You—

815
00:35:49,710 --> 00:35:50,590
Eunuch Zhao,

816
00:35:51,150 --> 00:35:52,590
I didn't say anything.

817
00:35:53,280 --> 00:35:54,960
You're the one shouting.

818
00:35:58,150 --> 00:35:59,810
You nearly scared me to death.

819
00:36:00,180 --> 00:36:01,020
Li Qingyang,

820
00:36:01,590 --> 00:36:02,830
don't you dare

821
00:36:03,410 --> 00:36:05,300
say things like that again.

822
00:36:08,360 --> 00:36:09,150
Eunuch Zhao,

823
00:36:11,190 --> 00:36:13,250
could it be that you're not so certain

824
00:36:13,590 --> 00:36:15,360
about this matter either?

825
00:36:16,030 --> 00:36:16,990
What if

826
00:36:17,710 --> 00:36:19,480
I bring the real murderer back,

827
00:36:20,000 --> 00:36:21,960
only for it to work
against the Crown Prince?

828
00:36:21,960 --> 00:36:22,710
Impossible.

829
00:36:23,390 --> 00:36:25,760
Absolutely impossible.

830
00:36:32,040 --> 00:36:34,130
Whether it's the First Prince's reaction

831
00:36:34,130 --> 00:36:36,020
or Eunuch Zhao's,

832
00:36:36,150 --> 00:36:37,760
it seems Prince Wenbu's death

833
00:36:37,760 --> 00:36:38,440
really

834
00:36:38,440 --> 00:36:40,500
has nothing to do with either of them.

835
00:36:40,710 --> 00:36:42,670
With Northern Kun's army
bearing down on us,

836
00:36:42,670 --> 00:36:44,480
besides the Ministry of War
and the Ministry of Revenue,

837
00:36:44,480 --> 00:36:46,360
who else stands to benefit?

838
00:37:03,070 --> 00:37:05,550
A master like Yan Zige

839
00:37:06,020 --> 00:37:07,530
would surely have

840
00:37:08,110 --> 00:37:11,910
inner power protecting his vital points
during a fight to the death.

841
00:37:11,920 --> 00:37:13,450
How could Meng Rui's strike

842
00:37:13,480 --> 00:37:14,920
have possibly

843
00:37:14,920 --> 00:37:16,580
ruptured his heart meridian?

844
00:38:10,840 --> 00:38:11,630
Right.

845
00:38:11,960 --> 00:38:14,420
Meng Rui treasures that sword of his
so much.

